y our carefully curated collection of cocktail recipes, \n                each with detailed instructions and a list of ingredients. \n                From classic favorites to modern twists, we've got you covered.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"content__right\">\n            <h2 class=\"content__right-title\">Cocktail Classes</h2>\n            <p class=\"content__right-paragraph\">\n                Take a class with us and learn how to craft the perfect cocktail. \n                Our classes are designed to give you a hands-on experience, \n                so you can confidently make your own cocktails at home.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer__logo\">\n            <h2>Dr Emma</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer__links\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer__links-item\">Wine</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer__links-item\">Beer</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer__links-item\">Cocktails</a>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
