 variety of conditions long-standing and recently\n        onset.\n      <br>\n      Areas of counselling I work with:\n     </p>\n     <ul>\n      <li>\n       <span>\n        Abuse\n       </span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n       <span>\n        Addiction\n       </span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n       <span>\n        Anger Management\n       </span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n       <span>\n        Anxiety\n       </span>\n      </li>\n     </ul>\n     <p>\n      Often several issues will be present at the same time. At the initial\n        consultation we will explore the current issues and your personal\n        background, and will establish the focus of the therapy.\n     </p>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"right\">\n     <div id=\"sidetop\">\n      <h2>\n       Contact\n      </h2>\n      <p>\n       Tel:\n       <br>\n       <span>\n        [PHONE REDACTED]\n       </span>\n      </p>\n      <p>\n       Email:\n       <br>\n       <a>\n        [EMAIL REDACTED]\n        <br>\n        @gmail.com\n       </a>\n      </p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"clear\">\n   </div>\n   <div id=\"footer\">\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>\n",
